# Security headers for every page. Netlify reads this file from the publish
# directory. No Content-Security-Policy yet: the pages load Google Analytics
# and embed Google Maps, so a CSP needs its own testing pass first.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
